15. IMPORTANT DOCKER CONCEPTS
========================================

IMAGE
-----

A packaged template used to create containers.


CONTAINER
---------

A running instance created from an image.


DOCKERFILE
----------

A set of instructions used to build an image.


PORT
----

A doorway through which we access an application.


